          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "“They stuck "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          458.4106662581699,
          256.16326325757586,
          107.79312009803931,
          67.67698390151509
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAG+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          720.1938909313725,
          256.16326325757586,
          229.1445616830066,
          67.67698390151509
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAG+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "me and were "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          410.41267973856213,
          317.85200820707075,
          556.3795968137255,
          67.67689330808082
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAG+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "always team players.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          436.48112089646463,
          227.25757185457513,
          13.6627840909091
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAC+HelveticaNeue-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bob Housley appreciates loyalty."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          457.96418907828286,
          325.117939501634,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "His company, Housley Communications, is a thriv-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          474.7881792929294,
          325.3651286356209,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ing business with a staff of 225 and contracting"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          491.6121565656566,
          325.3546106617647,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "relationships with over 700 firms. The company"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          508.43728566919197,
          325.7299750408497,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "provides engineering and implementation of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          525.2624147727273,
          325.0982769199346,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "advanced telecommunications systems. “We pro-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          542.0875827020202,
          325.21749178921567,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "vide everything a company needs to go from zero"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          558.9126988636365,
          108.61080714869283,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to 100 percent.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          580.3957799873738,
          325.2942997957516,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Success hasn’t necessarily been easy. “We had"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          597.2197702020203,
          325.33493133169935,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "some difficult times when we were starting out in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          614.0437474747475,
          325.399864746732,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the ’80s,” says Housley. “San Angelo National"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          630.8676859217171,
          325.2505865604575,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bank worked very diligently to help me get where"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          647.6916761363636,
          3.8842090277777856,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          67.73012083333334,
          647.6916761363636,
          317.20028848039215,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "am today. They stuck with me and were always"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          664.5156534090909,
          97.14286094771242,
          13.534672032828269
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "team players.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          685.9987345328283,
          325.49174628267974,
          13.534646148989964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Housley is a demanding customer – a trait to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          702.8227118055556,
          325.28982798202617,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "which he credits much of his success. “I am very"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          719.6466761363636,
          325.12393541666665,
          13.534646148989964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "customer service-oriented. It’s how I built my busi-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          736.4706534090909,
          325.3259877042484,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ness. I appreciate that I can get that same type of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          753.2946436237373,
          325.32146564542484,
          13.534646148989907
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "dedication from San Angelo National Bank, and I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          770.1186208964647,
          325.6681065767974,
          13.534646148989879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "see it reflected throughout the First Financial"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          786.9425981691919,
          175.96084391339872,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bankshares organization.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          808.4256663510101,
          325.041031004902,
          13.534646148989907
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Housley the shareholder is no less demanding, but"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          825.2496436237374,
          325.57620829248367,
          13.534646148989907
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "he’s had good reason to be pleased with his"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          842.0736208964647,
          325.52795625,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "returns from First Financial Bankshares. “First"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          858.8975852272727,
          325.271672753268,
          13.534659090909116
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Financial’s expansion strategy is excellent – they"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          875.7215625,
          325.3108806781046,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "do their research and find banks with good oppor-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          892.5455397727274,
          325.006428880719,
          13.534660385100992
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "tunity. Their operations are sound, and their growth"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          909.3695131628788,
          325.37119154411766,
          13.534659090909088
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is well-managed. I believe they are one of the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          59.67677455065359,
          926.1934943181818,
          304.37376507352946,
          13.534659090909102
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            197,
            78,
            22,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "best mid-size banking organizations around.”"
      }
    ],
